Output demos/gifs/quickstart.gif
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 50ms
Set Padding 20

Type "# VoiceAgent — 10 services, one command"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "demos/run-demo.sh services"
Enter
Sleep 4s

Type "demos/run-demo.sh healthz"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "demos/run-demo.sh login"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "# Dashboard: http://localhost:3000"
Enter
Sleep 2s
